## Why This Is Asked

Assesses real-time flag evaluation, caching strategy, per-tenant isolation, and resiliency under partial outages.

## Key Concepts

- Cache-aside with Azure Cache for Redis
- Azure App Configuration tenant scoping and labels
- TTL, eviction, prefetching, and cache warmup
- Event Grid change notifications for invalidation
- Auditing and tracing with Azure Monitor/OpenTelemetry

## Code Example

```javascript
async function getFlag(tenantId, flagName) {
  const key = `${tenantId}:${flagName}`;
  let val = await redis.get(key);
  if (val) return JSON.parse(val);
  const flag = await appConfig.getFlag(tenantId, flagName);
  await redis.setex(key, flag.ttl, JSON.stringify(flag));
  return flag;
}
```

## Why This Is Asked

